      "widgets_values": [
        "## Biblioteca de instruções (PT → EN)\n\nSempre termine com `isolated on a plain white background, same art style`. Peça **uma** peça por vez e diga o que NÃO deve aparecer.\n\n| quero | INSTRUÇÃO |\n|---|---|\n| mão aberta | `Show only this character's open right hand, palm facing the camera, fingers spread, isolated on a plain white background, same art style, same skin tone, no other body parts` |\n| mão fechada | `Show only this character's closed fist, back of the hand facing the camera, …` |\n| cabeça sem cabelo | `Show only this character's bald head and neck, no hair, front view, same face, same eyes, isolated on a plain white background, same art style` |\n| só o cabelo | `Show only this character's hairstyle as a separate object floating, no head, no face, no body, front view, isolated on a plain white background, same art style` |\n| roupa / torso | `Show only the outfit worn by this character as if on an invisible mannequin, no skin, no head, front view, isolated on a plain white background, same art style` |\n| botas / sapatos | `Show only this character's boots, pair side by side, front view, isolated on a plain white background, same art style` |\n| acessório (X) | `Show only this character's [X], centered, large, isolated on a plain white background, same art style` |\n| corpo sem roupa (base mesh) | `Show this character wearing a plain skin-tight grey bodysuit, A-pose, arms spread, front view, no accessories, isolated on a plain white background, same art style` |\n\n**Vistas para o Pixal3D MV**: repita a mesma instrução trocando só `front view` → `left side view` / `back view` / `right side view`, e acrescente `orthographic, same scale, same framing`. Salve como `<peça>_front/left/back/right.png`.\n\n**Se a peça sair redesenhada** (cor/forma diferente): encurte a instrução, tire adjetivos, gere mais seeds. Se ainda assim variar, use `Show only … exactly as drawn in the reference`.\n"
      ],
      "title": "Instruções prontas",
